      "decision_index": 117,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Haiku Hype has lethal on board: Doomsday Excruciator (6/6 flying) + Harvester of Misery (5/4 menace) = 11 damage against opponent at 7 life with no creatures and all lands tapped. Casting Insatiable Avarice mode 2 targeting the opponent gives them 3 cards for only 3 life loss, which is unnecessary and potentially dangerous. The opponent has Eddymurk Crab in their deck which could cost as little as UU with 11 instants/sorceries in graveyard, and one untapped Steam Vents could enable a flash blocker.",
      "action_taken": "Cast Insatiable Avarice mode 2 targeting opponent (draw 3 cards, lose 3 life) before combat",
