    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Archenemy's Charm doesn't deal damage. The player's reasoning was wrong about the card's effect. More importantly, they already have lethal on board with Doomsday Excruciator (6/6 flying) and Harvester of Misery (5/4 menace) against an opponent at 7hp with no untapped blockers. Casting Archenemy's Charm wastes a premium spell unnecessarily.",
